      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(google-meet): validate calendar Meet URLs",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nGoogle Calendar-derived Meet links were accepted when they merely parsed with the `meet.google.com` hostname. That let calendar `hangoutLink` and `conferenceData.entryPoints` values such as `http://meet.google.com/...`, `https://meet.google.com/not-a-code`, or `/lookup/...` pass calendar extraction even though Google Meet runtime entrypoints require an explicit `https://meet.google.com/<meeting-code>` URL.\n\nFree-text extraction had the same loose shape and could return Meet-like text that the runtime would later reject.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nCalendar lookup should return only meeting URLs that already satisfy the same local contract used by runtime joins. This keeps `--today` / `--event` calendar selection from surfacing malformed or unsupported links that fail later in a different code path.\n\nThe extraction path now normalizes through one calendar-local helper that requires:\n\n- `https:`\n- `meet.google.com`\n- a standard `xxx-xxxx-xxx` meeting-code path\n\nText extraction also avoids truncating longer tokens into fabricated meeting codes and trims sentence punctuation after query strings before URL normalization.\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers who select Google Meet sessions from Calendar get the same URL behavior as direct runtime joins. Invalid Calendar links are skipped instead of being selected and failing later when the meeting is joined.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `extensions/google-meet/src/calendar.ts` now validates and normalizes calendar-derived Meet URLs before returning them.\n- `extensions/google-meet/src/calendar.test.ts` covers rejected `http:` links, rejected non-code paths, rejected `/lookup/...` links, valid query strings, malformed entrypoint fallback, longer-token text rejection, and trailing punctuation cleanup.\n\n## Proof\n\n- `PNPM_CONFIG_MODULES_DIR=/media/vdc/0668001470/workSpace/claw-campaign-llagy/openclaw/node_modules node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/google-meet/src/calendar.test.ts`\n- `/media/vdc/0668001470/workSpace/claw-campaign-llagy/openclaw/node_modules/.bin/oxfmt --check extensions/google-meet/src/calendar.ts extensions/google-meet/src/calendar.test.ts`\n- `node scripts/run-oxlint.mjs --tsconfig config/tsconfig/oxlint.extensions.json extensions/google-meet/src/calendar.ts extensions/google-meet/src/calendar.test.ts`\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD && git diff --check`\n- `.agents/skills/autoreview/scripts/autoreview --mode local --engine claude`\n",
        "branch": "llagy007/google-meet-calendar-url-contract-20260712",
